<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>MSP du Calavon</title>

<link rel="stylesheet"
href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css">

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f5f7f6;
    color: #24332f;
}

header {
    background: #18352f;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px;
}

header h1 {
    margin: 0;
}

nav {
    background: white;
    padding: 12px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
}

button {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: white;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
    background: #eaf3ef;
}

main {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

.page {
    display: none;
}

.page.active {
    display: block;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border: 1px solid #dde5e1;
}

#map {
    height: 550px;
    border-radius: 12px;
}

.alert {
    background: #fff0f0;
    border-left: 5px solid #b23b3b;
    padding: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

textarea,
input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    margin-top: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}

td, th {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>MSP du Calavon</h1>
<p>Outil numérique de coordination territoriale</p>
</header>

<nav>
<button onclick="showPage('carte')">🗺️ Carte</button>
<button onclick="showPage('annuaire')">👥 Annuaire</button>
<button onclick="showPage('risques')">⚠️ Risques</button>
<button onclick="showPage('crise')">🚨
